flowchart TD
    U[User] --> APP[Flutter app: UI and inspection state]
    APP <-->|Sign in and ID token| AUTH[Firebase Authentication]
    CHECK[Firebase App Check / Play Integrity] --> APP
    APP -->|Authenticated callable operations| API[Firebase Cloud Functions: TypeScript]
    API --> GATE[Require user, enforce App Check, ownership, validation, quota]
    GATE --> FLOW[Inspection workflow: analyze, answer, classify]
    APP -->|Owner-scoped upload after inspection creation| STORE[Private Cloud Storage: temporary images]
    STORE -->|Validated image bytes| FLOW
    FLOW <-->|Questions, answers, result, status, usage| DB[Firestore: owner-scoped inspection records]
    RULES[Versioned commodity grading rules] --> FLOW
    FLOW --> ROUTER[Provider adapters: deadlines, approved fallback, schema checks]
    SECRETS[Secret Manager: server-only keys] --> ROUTER
    ROUTER <-->|Image and prompt; JSON result| AI[Approved and tested AI providers]
    FLOW -->|Validated response or operation status| API
    API --> APP
    FLOW --> OBS[Redacted logs, latency, cost, failure alerts]
    DELETE[Account deletion and retention cleanup] --> DB
    DELETE --> STORE
    DELETE --> AUTH
